cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this handbook, please cite it as below."
title: "ML Research Handbook"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English–Bangla) study and reference handbook that takes
  students and early-career researchers from machine learning foundations
  to reading research papers, critical analysis, research gap
  identification and formulating testable research questions, and on
  to research with large language models and the path from a proposal
  to a published paper.
